        {
          "resource": "repo://talos/talenv.yaml#L1-L4",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4ae26d952e597f70c4bbe7665882b09fe952fe44746284b6ff794e03502b0c1d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_33fa47a7e2944a43bad1ce2636cfdc73",
      "statement": "The `talos:apply-node` task uses `talhelper gencommand apply` with `--mode=auto` by default to apply updated machine configuration to a specific node identified by IP address, supporting mode overrides for reboot behavior control.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.taskfiles/talos/Taskfile.yaml#L17-L29",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:35ce0aa449263507466334f03fc68ca500a4142bce0b6b479f91f5e911098d74:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7362a9db988240f1b0cf547be16c7db0",
      "statement": "The `talos:upgrade-node` task retrieves the node-specific Talos image URL from `talconfig.yaml` and the Talos version from `talenv.yaml`, then executes `talhelper gencommand upgrade` with `--image` and `--timeout=10m` flags to upgrade a single node.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.taskfiles/talos/Taskfile.yaml#L31-L46",
