      "id": "claim_19ab7a47a4254d2ca7d1ecbce4a777c2",
      "statement": "The `talos:upgrade-k8s` task retrieves the Kubernetes version from `talenv.yaml` and executes `talhelper gencommand upgrade-k8s` with the `--to` flag to upgrade Kubernetes across all control plane and worker nodes.",
