    {
      "id": "claim_dcc3584e4b7b47249c85b65bf36f036e",
      "statement": "The `talos:reset` task prompts for confirmation, then executes `talhelper gencommand reset` with `--reboot`, `--system-labels-to-wipe STATE`, `--system-labels-to-wipe EPHEMERAL`, `--graceful=false`, and `--wait=false` flags to destroy the cluster and reset nodes to maintenance mode.",
