      "statement": "Talos and Kubernetes versions are managed in `talos/talenv.yaml` using Renovate datasource annotations that track `ghcr.io/siderolabs/installer` and `ghcr.io/siderolabs/kubelet` for automated dependency updates, with variables referenced by `talconfig.yaml` and upgrade tasks.",
